{"name":"The Drain Glass","slug":"glyph-drain-glass","blurb":"On the veto street, Yael carries the glass toward the bracket lamp. The mark is Drain. Click the glass and it lights. A touch does not keep a step. A step away from the lamp is not kept. A step is kept only when the gap shrinks. The page proves its own street law on load. Glyph: The Drain Glass.","seal":"b3b6861eea9165e3a479402dbfa5fce52e35dd66ac0e8a82c420e1150739d5d8"}
